      "journal": "Physical Review A",
      "notes": "arXiv:2402.13541. Absolute frequency measurements of the 431nm inner-shell transition for 170,172,173,174,176Yb at ~10 kHz accuracy. Also provides hyperfine A and B constants for 173Yb and A for 171Yb in the 4f13 5d 6s2 (J=2) excited state.",
